WEBVTT

00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:12.010
How terribly I have failed...

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:16.760
Who knows how much just this one IV will cost...!

00:00:16.970 --> 00:00:21.480
Even if I heal, I won't be able to face His Majesty...

00:00:21.690 --> 00:00:25.940
Oh! Mr. Ashiya, you're awake!

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:31.110
Yes, Ma'am... Er, I'd like to ask you one more time...

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:34.610
You accept public health insurance, correct?

00:00:34.820 --> 00:00:38.160
Yes, everything's fine.
Okay, I'm giving you another bag of--

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:40.040
No thank you!

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:47.250
What?

00:00:49.130 --> 00:00:53.010
Excuse me, are you all right?

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:55.010
A policeman?

00:00:55.220 --> 00:00:57.100
What on Earth...?

00:01:05.190 --> 00:01:06.810
Olba!

00:01:13.610 --> 00:01:14.700
Mr. Ashiya!

00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:17.450
See? I <i>told</i> you not to move yet!

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:20.200
I'm adding a bag! You're getting two now!

00:01:20.410 --> 00:01:21.830
I-I can't believe it...

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:24.250
I can't believe <i>you</i>! Is it your tummy?

00:01:24.460 --> 00:01:26.330
--Did you get a tummyache?!
--"Villa Rosa Sasazuka"...

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:27.000
You're wrong--

00:01:27.210 --> 00:01:29.170
I most certainly am not!

00:01:32.170 --> 00:01:34.760
I'm coming, Chi!

00:01:46.350 --> 00:01:50.610
<i>Kono shunkan, kono basho ga sutaato</i>

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:56.650
<i>Imeeji shite miyou naniga dekiru no ka na</i>

00:01:56.860 --> 00:02:00.620
<i>Shinjirarenai dekigoto datte aru</i>

00:02:00.830 --> 00:02:06.330
<i>Motto... koete yukeru ne</i>

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:17.300
<i>Zero kara umareru subete kagayaite ano sora e</i>

00:02:18.470 --> 00:02:21.760
<i>Omoikiri habatakitai</i>

00:02:21.970 --> 00:02:28.900
<i>Saikou no sumairu de warainagara saa yukou!</i>

00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:34.730
<i>Michi no sekai e to ima tobidasou yo</i>

00:02:34.940 --> 00:02:39.410
<i>Mirai wo erabi, kimeru no wa jibun</i>

00:02:39.610 --> 00:02:41.700
<i>Yume wo oikakete yukou</i>

00:02:41.910 --> 00:02:43.330
<i>Naku hi mo aru</i>

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:49.580
<i>Sore wa daiji na negai, kienaide</i>

00:02:49.790 --> 00:02:57.510
<i>Kitto aeru kara, asu no kimi e...</i>

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:21.360
Why don't you just give up already, and hand over Better Half?

00:03:21.570 --> 00:03:25.540
It's not materializing, so what do you expect from me?

00:03:25.740 --> 00:03:28.910
I'd say the sword itself is rejecting you.

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:32.830
By rights, the sacred sword shouldn't be in human hands.

00:03:33.040 --> 00:03:35.800
We must take it back.

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:37.800
This is Heaven's collective will.

00:03:38.010 --> 00:03:43.430
More importantly, Chiho's got nothing to do with this. Let her go.

00:03:43.640 --> 00:03:48.100
I can't do that. She's a precious sample.

00:03:48.310 --> 00:03:52.810
A human from another world who reveres the Devil even knowing who he is.

00:03:53.020 --> 00:03:58.400
It's worth investigating what effects the Devil's power has on human ecology.

00:03:58.610 --> 00:04:00.360
You sicko!

00:04:00.570 --> 00:04:05.950
That's no way for a mere human to speak to the great archangel Sariel.

00:04:15.290 --> 00:04:16.670
Ow!

00:04:18.050 --> 00:04:19.510
Shit, a barrier field?

00:04:19.710 --> 00:04:22.510
I don't think your body can take much more.

00:04:22.720 --> 00:04:26.800
I wish you wouldn't make me keep doing this--I'm a ladies' man.

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:34.690
Women shouldn't make such unseemly screams.

00:04:34.900 --> 00:04:38.480
Do try to sound more ladylike.

00:04:38.690 --> 00:04:43.200
Ah, it seems a pest snuck his way in.

00:04:43.400 --> 00:04:45.200
Ma... ou...

00:04:45.410 --> 00:04:50.410
Let's give our guest a warm welcome. Right, Bel?

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:54.250
At the Devil's current power level, you're quite capable of defeating him alone.

00:04:56.630 --> 00:04:58.800
So you're fine with that, then?

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:01.800
The Devil and I perish in another world,

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:07.850
and Ente Isla goes on the same as it did before you came.

00:05:08.050 --> 00:05:10.970
And you're honestly fine with that.

00:05:11.180 --> 00:05:16.270
Why be troubled? I, the patron angel of the Doctrinal Correction Council,

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:20.020
hereby guarantee the orthodoxy of your actions.

00:05:20.230 --> 00:05:21.530
Go.

00:05:22.740 --> 00:05:27.030
Miss Suzuno... why?

00:05:27.240 --> 00:05:29.030
Why?

00:05:35.920 --> 00:05:38.710
Please, help me.

00:05:38.920 --> 00:05:41.960
I don't want to sacrifice anyone else!

00:05:42.170 --> 00:05:44.590
Man, what a pain!

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:48.760
Wham!

00:05:50.970 --> 00:05:53.020
Ugh, so tired...

00:05:56.730 --> 00:05:57.940
What was that?!

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:01.480
Suzuno...

00:06:01.690 --> 00:06:03.990
D-D-D-Dullahan!

00:06:04.190 --> 00:06:08.950
How could you <i>do</i> that?!
What did the Dullahan ever do to you?!

00:06:09.160 --> 00:06:14.370
You better reimburse me for the new bike, the bike registration fee,

00:06:14.580 --> 00:06:17.000
and the oversized-garbage disposal fee!

00:06:18.830 --> 00:06:19.880
Wait! Hey!

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:23.500
Quiet! Shut up, shut up, shut <i>up</i>!

00:06:23.710 --> 00:06:27.300
Stop! Please, just wait! I only need a minute!

00:06:29.260 --> 00:06:31.930
Wh-Wh-What are you doing?!

00:06:32.140 --> 00:06:35.270
Okay! All ready.

00:06:35.480 --> 00:06:38.100
What do you think you're doing?

00:06:38.310 --> 00:06:41.860
You probably don't know, since you've got no job.

00:06:42.070 --> 00:06:45.940
Listen up: MgRonald's uniforms are given to employees on <i>loan.</i>

00:06:46.150 --> 00:06:51.660
If you let one get damaged for non-work reasons, you have to pay for it.

00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:54.200
The Devil's Castle doesn't have that kind of money lyin' around!

00:06:54.410 --> 00:06:55.910
Give me a break!

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:00.210
Hey--

00:07:01.210 --> 00:07:03.500
Y-Y-You can't do that in public, you pervert!

00:07:03.710 --> 00:07:05.250
You're the one who did it!

00:07:05.460 --> 00:07:08.220
You had the guts to come to Japan all alone and settle right in next door,

00:07:08.420 --> 00:07:11.180
plus you're a good cook, so I figured I'd let a lot of things slide,

00:07:11.390 --> 00:07:13.510
but if you're gonna get in my way and hurt my crew,

00:07:13.720 --> 00:07:15.720
as substitute manager, I can't let that pass!

00:07:15.930 --> 00:07:19.190
You knew who I really was?

00:07:19.390 --> 00:07:20.770
Of course I did!

00:07:20.980 --> 00:07:23.860
In what world does a perfect
Japanese maiden move in

00:07:24.070 --> 00:07:27.740
and suddenly start slaving away for an all-male household next door?!

00:07:30.400 --> 00:07:32.950
We still have leftovers from Suzuno.

00:07:34.370 --> 00:07:37.910
It's a little celestial force-y, but eh, why not.

00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:41.250
Seems like you really did a number on Ashiya, though.

00:07:41.460 --> 00:07:42.960
It's a shame.

00:07:43.170 --> 00:07:47.300
I thought you showed a lot of promise-- you even get along with <i>Emi.</i>

00:07:47.510 --> 00:07:49.970
But in the end you're just like Olba, eh?

00:07:50.170 --> 00:07:51.340
You pretend to be good,

00:07:51.550 --> 00:07:55.100
but really you don't care what you sacrifice to get power, is that it?

00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:55.970
No!

00:07:56.180 --> 00:08:01.640
If you fight dirty to get what you want, how are you different from us demons?

00:08:01.850 --> 00:08:02.400
Shut up!

00:08:02.600 --> 00:08:05.770
You go to Hushimaen with Emi and
Chi and help 'em with the bazaar--

00:08:05.980 --> 00:08:08.990
You make <i>friends,</i> and then drag 'em into this?

00:08:09.190 --> 00:08:10.490
Aren't you ashamed?

00:08:10.700 --> 00:08:12.200
Shut up!

00:08:14.490 --> 00:08:15.530
That's crazy...

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:19.620
Wh-Why?

00:08:19.830 --> 00:08:24.210
I used up almost all my magic on the barrier.

00:08:24.420 --> 00:08:28.210
What's the matter? Not gonna attack me?

00:08:28.420 --> 00:08:31.340
I'm leavin', then.

00:08:31.550 --> 00:08:33.720
Chi's waitin' for me.

00:08:33.930 --> 00:08:38.390
It's no use. You can't beat him the way you are now.

00:08:38.600 --> 00:08:41.480
You've got someone else with you?

00:08:41.680 --> 00:08:43.810
The archangel Sariel.

00:08:44.020 --> 00:08:47.480
That would do it. Emi couldn't take him down.

00:08:47.690 --> 00:08:52.360
--Ow, ouch...
--Sariel gets more powerful the closer he is to the moon.

00:08:52.570 --> 00:08:56.030
With no magic, you haven't got a chance of winning.

00:08:56.240 --> 00:08:58.200
So you wanna run away?

00:08:58.410 --> 00:09:00.870
Why would you do all this?

00:09:01.080 --> 00:09:04.960
Chi's my junior at work that I gotta protect, and an important member of my command.

00:09:05.170 --> 00:09:09.250
I don't abandon my men and run.
I've got <i>some</i> sense of shame.

00:09:09.460 --> 00:09:12.760
And really, you're countin' on me too, aren't you?

00:09:12.970 --> 00:09:14.010
To do what?

00:09:14.220 --> 00:09:16.510
To take down Sariel.

00:09:18.220 --> 00:09:22.430
Isn't that why you didn't stop Chi from callin' me?

00:09:22.640 --> 00:09:25.310
I-I...

00:09:25.520 --> 00:09:27.770
Well, it's the same difference to me.

00:09:30.270 --> 00:09:33.950
Why would a demon like you say that?

00:09:34.150 --> 00:09:36.660
Why are <i>you</i> the Devil?

00:09:36.860 --> 00:09:39.370
When the Devil says that to me...

00:09:41.660 --> 00:09:46.370
It means I can't stay shameless either!

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:51.380
What's Maou doing?

00:09:51.590 --> 00:09:55.050
I know he's gotten himself mixed up in some kind of trouble.

00:09:55.260 --> 00:09:58.260
Wonder what's up at the government offices...

00:09:58.470 --> 00:09:59.640
Maou?

00:09:59.850 --> 00:10:01.680
Did he leave Emilia to fend for herself?

00:10:01.890 --> 00:10:03.350
Oof...

00:10:03.560 --> 00:10:06.060
Well? Was there a probl--

00:10:06.270 --> 00:10:07.350
Olba?

00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:10.190
It's been a long time, Lucifer.

00:10:10.400 --> 00:10:13.860
So, you got out. Looks like you're doing well.

00:10:14.070 --> 00:10:15.570
You could say that.

00:10:15.780 --> 00:10:18.320
Not a bad home you've got here.

00:10:18.530 --> 00:10:19.700
You could say that.

00:10:19.910 --> 00:10:22.910
Would you like to go back to Heaven?

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:28.250
Come with me again. I'll grant that wish.

00:10:40.590 --> 00:10:45.180
If the sacred sword won't separate from you after this much torture,

00:10:45.390 --> 00:10:48.980
I suppose I'll have to remove it from your body directly.

00:10:49.190 --> 00:10:51.730
"Directly"...?

00:10:51.940 --> 00:10:54.780
H-Hey! What do you think you're doing?!

00:10:54.980 --> 00:10:58.150
--Extracting the heavenly silver
--St-Stop that...!

00:10:58.360 --> 00:11:02.450
--that forms Better Half straight out of your flesh.
--Y-You jerk, let me go!

00:11:02.660 --> 00:11:05.410
What are you doing to Miss Yusa, you pervert?!

00:11:05.620 --> 00:11:12.250
"Pervert"? How rude. And in any case, her meager bust size isn't to my taste.

00:11:12.460 --> 00:11:17.380
--I'll kill him. I swear I'll kill him!
--It would be fair to say that you're more to my taste in that sense, too.

00:11:17.590 --> 00:11:22.930
Don't you worry; I'll investigate <i>your</i> body <i>quite thoroughly</i> later.

00:11:23.140 --> 00:11:25.430
You're depraved beyond all redemption, you scum!

00:11:25.640 --> 00:11:26.890
--Molester!
--Sicko!

00:11:27.100 --> 00:11:28.600
--Deviant!
--Filthy Peeping Tom!

00:11:28.810 --> 00:11:31.770
--Panty snatcher!
--I haven't done <i>that</i> much!

00:11:31.980 --> 00:11:33.900
That's enough, you wenches!

00:11:34.110 --> 00:11:38.360
You just <i>try</i> laying a finger on Chiho. You'll regret it.

00:11:38.570 --> 00:11:42.370
Big talk is all very well, but what can you possibly do now?

00:11:42.570 --> 00:11:47.500
I'm not talking about me. If you mess with her, you'll answer to the Devil.

00:11:47.700 --> 00:11:52.120
The <i>Devil</i>? Does the hero
Emilia count on the Devil's help?

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:53.960
Not what I'm saying.

00:11:54.170 --> 00:11:58.340
You ran a restaurant across from
MgRonald's, and you didn't notice?

00:11:58.550 --> 00:11:59.720
What do you mean?

00:11:59.920 --> 00:12:07.100
That girl works for MgRonald's, and the Devil is its shift manager.

00:12:07.310 --> 00:12:12.520
If an employee is in danger, it's the supervisor's duty to protect her.

00:12:12.730 --> 00:12:14.650
Are you out of your mind?

00:12:14.860 --> 00:12:19.280
Do you seriously think the Devil is bound by this world's conventions?

00:12:19.490 --> 00:12:26.200
Dammit... why is... the elevator... broken?!

00:12:26.410 --> 00:12:31.870
He's not bound by them.
He follows them of his own free will.

00:12:32.080 --> 00:12:35.920
That's the A-level staffer and shift manager of the Hatagaya MgRonald's:

00:12:36.130 --> 00:12:39.260
the man called Sadao Maou.

00:12:41.050 --> 00:12:44.590
This is priceless!
A Devil who's trusted by a hero?! I--

00:12:44.800 --> 00:12:46.010
Yo.

00:12:48.140 --> 00:12:49.220
Mr. Maou!

00:12:49.430 --> 00:12:50.720
Sorry to keep you waiting, Chi.

00:12:50.930 --> 00:12:52.060
M-Mr. Maou?!

00:12:52.270 --> 00:12:53.350
Looks like you're safe too, Emi.

00:12:53.560 --> 00:12:55.940
--Stay away from me! And don't look!
--Aren't you being mean?!

00:12:56.150 --> 00:12:58.570
To think you really came to the rescue...

00:12:58.770 --> 00:13:02.780
I sure as heck never thought the perfumed dwarf managing the SFC

00:13:02.990 --> 00:13:04.240
was Mr. Gaze of the Fall.

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:07.160
I needed to take back the sacred sword, you see.

00:13:07.370 --> 00:13:11.870
The evolving heavenly silver that forms
Better Half is Heaven's cherished treasure.

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:14.620
We can't very well let the hero keep it.

00:13:14.830 --> 00:13:17.290
Frankly, I couldn't care less about Heaven's problems.

00:13:17.500 --> 00:13:21.260
It's hurting someone from my restaurant that I won't let you get away with.

00:13:21.460 --> 00:13:24.680
How <i>dare</i> you scare Chi like that!

00:13:24.880 --> 00:13:26.220
Mr. Maou!

00:13:26.430 --> 00:13:29.180
Chi's my junior at work and an important member of my command.

00:13:29.390 --> 00:13:33.140
As the Devil and as the shift manager,
I protect my command!

00:13:33.350 --> 00:13:35.060
Yes, of course...

00:13:36.730 --> 00:13:39.770
What can you do with that frail little body?

00:13:45.150 --> 00:13:45.860
Mr. Maou!

00:13:46.070 --> 00:13:49.240
How long can you hold out with what little magic you have left?

00:13:54.910 --> 00:13:55.620
Mr. Maou!

00:13:55.830 --> 00:13:57.000
Maou!

00:13:57.210 --> 00:14:00.460
Don't worry, Chi.

00:14:01.840 --> 00:14:03.590
I ain't gonna lose!

00:14:05.130 --> 00:14:09.640
You're really something, Satan!
Just how long will that false courage last?

00:14:09.850 --> 00:14:13.100
Dammit... I can't do any real damage without magic!

00:14:13.310 --> 00:14:14.560
What do I do?

00:14:14.770 --> 00:14:19.270
My power increases the closer I get to the moon.

00:14:19.480 --> 00:14:22.730
You're in a pinch, Satan. What will you do?

00:14:37.670 --> 00:14:43.050
Divine souls who maintain life and time,

00:14:43.250 --> 00:14:48.340
discover this world beyond the stars.

00:14:51.430 --> 00:14:53.180
Destroying this place would--

00:14:53.390 --> 00:14:55.180
Cause a panic...

00:14:55.390 --> 00:14:55.890
Lucifer?!

00:14:56.100 --> 00:15:00.100
...and maybe get us some magic from the fear and anger?

00:15:00.310 --> 00:15:04.280
It's too late to do any good.
I mean, look over there.

00:15:06.070 --> 00:15:07.440
What is that?

00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:19.790
What is this?! Who...?

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:23.000
Magnificent! Look how close the moon is!

00:15:23.210 --> 00:15:24.960
I'm brimming with power!

00:15:25.170 --> 00:15:28.130
Okay, this is no time to hold back!

00:15:28.340 --> 00:15:29.470
Huh?

00:15:32.970 --> 00:15:35.350
Hey, you jerk, lemme go!

00:15:36.640 --> 00:15:39.350
Struggling is no use now.

00:15:39.560 --> 00:15:44.150
No one can beat me while
I have <i>this</i> much power!

00:15:50.610 --> 00:15:52.160
What's going on?!

00:15:55.410 --> 00:15:57.120
"Central Police Hospital"

00:16:04.790 --> 00:16:06.500
Sire.

00:16:10.970 --> 00:16:13.640
What? What's happening?!

00:16:13.840 --> 00:16:16.600
Magic is gathering... Which means...

00:16:16.810 --> 00:16:19.350
There's probably major panic down in the streets.

00:16:19.560 --> 00:16:20.890
Mr. Maou...

00:16:23.690 --> 00:16:29.610
Mmm, this is great.
Thanks to you, I've replenished my magic.

00:16:32.030 --> 00:16:33.700
You're all right now.

00:16:35.160 --> 00:16:37.080
You simpleton!

00:16:37.280 --> 00:16:39.750
Put a damper on that ridiculous power of yours!

00:16:39.950 --> 00:16:41.660
Are you trying to kill the good Chiho?!

00:16:41.870 --> 00:16:42.580
Oh, sorry!

00:16:42.790 --> 00:16:44.960
Do you plan to fight in those?!

00:16:45.170 --> 00:16:49.300
Not to worry! This underwear is made from a new fabric that's ultra-durable!

00:16:49.510 --> 00:16:52.050
How much faith are you putting in that underwear?!

00:16:53.760 --> 00:16:56.180
Hey, Suzuno, you take care of those two.

00:16:56.390 --> 00:16:57.720
Understood.

00:16:57.930 --> 00:17:01.810
Um... Miss Suzuno?

00:17:02.020 --> 00:17:06.060
I'll... explain things later.

00:17:06.270 --> 00:17:07.730
Um...

00:17:09.070 --> 00:17:10.320
I'm sorry.

00:17:10.530 --> 00:17:11.490
Miss Suzuno!

00:17:11.690 --> 00:17:15.110
You mean to align yourself with the Devil?!
Have you lost your wits, Bel?!

00:17:15.320 --> 00:17:17.950
You're the one who's lost his wits, Sariel.

00:17:18.160 --> 00:17:22.370
You force a false peace on our people, create chaos for another world,

00:17:22.580 --> 00:17:25.620
and betray those we should protect, those who die for their faith?!

00:17:25.830 --> 00:17:28.710
Is that really the sort of justice God exhibits?!

00:17:28.920 --> 00:17:31.880
As head investigator of the
Doctrinal Correction Council,

00:17:32.090 --> 00:17:36.140
I cannot allow a "justice" so full of falsehood to go unchallenged!

00:17:36.340 --> 00:17:38.140
"Correction"? Get off your high horse!

00:17:38.350 --> 00:17:42.770
The Inquisition's bloodthirsty god of death has no place talking of justice!

00:17:42.980 --> 00:17:43.930
Shut your mouth!

00:17:44.140 --> 00:17:48.360
If nothing else, I know that the
Devil's--Sadao Maou's--life in Japan

00:17:48.560 --> 00:17:50.690
is no trespass against justice!

00:17:50.900 --> 00:17:56.820
Say what you want, but with the power of this giant moon, no one can beat me!

00:17:57.030 --> 00:17:58.740
I wouldn't be so sure.

00:18:00.870 --> 00:18:06.120
Excellent. Now the great Sariel will dispose of the Devil for us.

00:18:06.330 --> 00:18:09.670
Hey, can I have Emilia's bag back?

00:18:09.880 --> 00:18:10.540
Hmm?

00:18:10.750 --> 00:18:13.210
Sure. But what do you plan to do with it?

00:18:13.420 --> 00:18:15.260
Huh? Give it back to Emilia.

00:18:15.470 --> 00:18:16.130
What?

00:18:16.340 --> 00:18:18.140
I mean, if I don't, she'll kill me.

00:18:18.340 --> 00:18:22.770
Wh-Wh-Why, you! D-D-Don't tell me--?!

00:18:22.970 --> 00:18:24.890
You tricked me!

00:18:34.110 --> 00:18:38.860
Heaven can be found on Earth in a one-room second-floor apartment, you know?

00:18:39.070 --> 00:18:40.700
NEETs rule!

00:18:40.910 --> 00:18:43.490
You take things from here, Satan.

00:18:47.080 --> 00:18:48.670
Th-The moon...

00:18:48.870 --> 00:18:51.000
Hey, Sariel.

00:18:51.210 --> 00:18:54.130
--I'm a merciful Devil, so I'll let you pick.
--Pick what?

00:18:54.340 --> 00:18:59.300
Run home with your tail between your legs, or end this with a beating from me.

00:18:59.510 --> 00:19:00.800
So, which is it?

00:19:01.010 --> 00:19:05.890
That's obvious. I'll defeat you and achieve my goal!

00:19:06.100 --> 00:19:09.650
A Devil who can only get magic by doping himself with human negativity

00:19:09.850 --> 00:19:11.690
is nothing to be afraid of!

00:19:14.230 --> 00:19:15.860
Oh, crap!

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:28.460
Enough flitting around!

00:19:33.590 --> 00:19:35.670
He's on a freaking rampage!

00:19:37.170 --> 00:19:38.300
Come here, Chiho Sasaki!

00:19:38.510 --> 00:19:39.760
Pow!

00:19:54.900 --> 00:19:55.900
You okay?

00:19:56.110 --> 00:19:57.650
--You're something, all right.
--Sorry...

00:19:57.860 --> 00:20:03.910
Eh, I don't care anymore. That perv tormented me all day, and I'm worn out.

00:20:04.120 --> 00:20:05.330
Now put me down.

00:20:05.530 --> 00:20:06.990
--Hey, Emi.
--What?

00:20:07.200 --> 00:20:08.830
Your shirt's open.

00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:18.840
That damn Devil! I swear
I'll kill him once I get the sword!

00:20:19.050 --> 00:20:20.760
I'll wring his neck!

00:20:20.970 --> 00:20:26.220
Give it up. You may be invincible against anyone with celestial force,

00:20:26.430 --> 00:20:27.760
but up against <i>me--</i>

00:20:27.970 --> 00:20:29.730
Whatever, put me down.

00:20:31.350 --> 00:20:36.190
You may be invincible against anyone with celestial force...

00:20:36.400 --> 00:20:39.820
...but you chose the wrong guy to pick a fight with.

00:20:40.030 --> 00:20:43.360
I'll give you <i>my</i> sacred sword.

00:20:43.570 --> 00:20:47.870
Go on, you pervy angel, beg God for mercy.

00:20:51.710 --> 00:20:56.540
O Lord, please save this lost sheep...

00:21:05.260 --> 00:21:10.020
Yeesh, he trashed this whole place!

00:21:10.220 --> 00:21:14.190
I finally get my magic back, and I'm gonna have to fix everything <i>again</i>?

00:21:14.390 --> 00:21:16.480
It's your fault for dawdling.

00:21:16.690 --> 00:21:20.900
Excuse me? Is that any way to talk to the guy who saved you?

00:21:21.110 --> 00:21:22.900
Nobody asked you to.

00:21:23.110 --> 00:21:25.070
What was that, Miss Flat-Chested?!

00:21:25.280 --> 00:21:26.910
You--I--gah!

00:21:27.120 --> 00:21:28.490
More importantly, Emilia--

00:21:28.700 --> 00:21:31.160
What do you mean, "more importantly"?!
This is <i>very</i> important!

00:21:31.370 --> 00:21:34.370
--And doesn't it bother <i>you</i> to hear that about us?!
--Please calm down! Please don't fight!

00:21:34.580 --> 00:21:37.750
--How rude! What does it have to do with me?!

00:21:35.500 --> 00:21:37.750
--Sire. Apologies for my lateness.

00:21:37.960 --> 00:21:40.210
I went back to the Devil's Castle for a cape.

00:21:40.420 --> 00:21:44.470
Darn right you're late! What did you even come for?! The whole thing's <i>over</i>!

00:21:44.680 --> 00:21:46.590
--Forget that, just put on some clothes!
--What am I...

00:21:46.800 --> 00:21:51.560
--What is the meaning of my existence?!

00:21:46.800 --> 00:21:49.470
--Huh?! Aw, man, I left my uniform downstairs!

00:21:49.470 --> 00:21:51.560
--Wait, crap, I bailed out of <i>work</i>!

00:21:51.770 --> 00:21:56.560
--Mr. Maou, don't go back looking like that!
--I even brought His Majesty's cape!

00:21:58.610 --> 00:22:00.320
Wonder if it's over...

00:22:01.480 --> 00:22:05.700
Phew, I worked too hard.
I want some fried fish...

00:22:23.170 --> 00:22:28.510
<i>Doko kara asa ni naru? Shizuka na sora</i>

00:22:28.720 --> 00:22:34.100
<i>Minai furi wo shita yubikiri koyubi no saki</i>

00:22:34.310 --> 00:22:44.310
<i>Warawareta tsuki nara kiete</i> <i>yuku n da kinou no houkaku e</i>

00:22:45.110 --> 00:22:50.240
<i>Usotsuki okubyoumono</i> <i>minna matomete boku nara</i>

00:22:50.450 --> 00:22:56.040
<i>Saite ita no wa yume no naka da</i>

00:22:56.250 --> 00:23:01.500
<i>Tsuki no kage ni kakushiteta</i> <i>hontou wa ne naiteta</i>

00:23:01.710 --> 00:23:07.220
<i>Namida wa mou nagarenai karete shimatta no?</i>

00:23:07.420 --> 00:23:13.850
<i>Nani mo ka mo yurusetara</i> <i>nagareru ka mo shirenai kedo</i>

00:23:14.060 --> 00:23:21.400
<i>Mamoritai mono bakari da na</i>
